{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1922. Miss Mulligatawney's School for Promising Girls is one of the best boarding schools in England. You are Verity Amersham, here on a scholarship - and today you're going to be expelled for attempted murder.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2963890/extras/cf93423e81f7adc21e105289e7de9031.poster.avif?t=1772555314\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2963890/extras/cf93423e81f7adc21e105289e7de9031.webm?t=1772555314\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2963890/extras/cf93423e81f7adc21e105289e7de9031.mp4?t=1772555314\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>From the creators of Overboard! and A Highland Song comes a highly replayable detective game with a wicked twist. Can you escape expulsion through fair means - or foul? Can you find the culprit - or someone else to take the blame?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Starring Amelia Tyler (Baldur's Gate 3) as Verity. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2963890/extras/cb675b0007905708fbf1bbb27442315c.poster.avif?t=1772555314\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2963890/extras/cb675b0007905708fbf1bbb27442315c.webm?t=1772555314\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2963890/extras/cb675b0007905708fbf1bbb27442315c.mp4?t=1772555314\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>GAMEPLAY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gossip, lie, steal, manipulate - but don't get caught! </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate the school day, talk to other characters, sneak around - and try not to get expelled! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your actions will affect other characters, who remember everything they see and hear.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everyone here has secrets - students and teachers alike. Remember, knowledge is power. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique morality system: the more EVIL you are, the more choices you'll have...  </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2963890/extras/909e733d35c4d7d82b88534c422f56cf.poster.avif?t=1772555314\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2963890/extras/909e733d35c4d7d82b88534c422f56cf.webm?t=1772555314\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2963890/extras/909e733d35c4d7d82b88534c422f56cf.mp4?t=1772555314\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DYNAMIC NARRATIVE CLOCKWORK</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Next-gen visual novel: go where you want, when you want, and say what you want. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simulated story-world: other characters move and act independently, remembering everything they see and hear - and everything you do. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every minute counts: you have one school day to escape punishment. The clock is always ticking! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Who can you trust? Some characters are friendly and some are out to get you. Who will you befriend? Who will you betray? </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2963890/extras/7faa3a1fc34af99dc8c0f6e659b13cd0.poster.avif?t=1772555314\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2963890/extras/7faa3a1fc34af99dc8c0f6e659b13cd0.webm?t=1772555314\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2963890/extras/7faa3a1fc34af99dc8c0f6e659b13cd0.mp4?t=1772555314\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >HIGHLY REPLAYABLE</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run is different, with new leads and new opportunities for mayhem.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Avoiding expulsion is just the start. Can you rise to the position of Head Girl?  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mysteries abound. Why is the cellar locked? What is your best friend's dark secret?  </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One play-through lasts about 30 - 45 minutes, but achieving that perfect run will take a lot longer... </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With music by jazz legends George Gershwin, Paul Whiteman, Louis Armstrong, Bessie Smith and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2963890/extras/485edd97842abae5123df84318e61d2a.poster.avif?t=1772555314\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2963890/extras/485edd97842abae5123df84318e61d2a.webm?t=1772555314\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2963890/extras/485edd97842abae5123df84318e61d2a.mp4?t=1772555314\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SOMEONE HAS TO TAKE THE FALL</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Raffles","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2963890/e23f1bd9fa8e18e7462df73a28ed27bf2fe5a521.jpg"},{"name":"An Eligible Bachelor","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2963890/e23f1bd9fa8e18e7462df73a28ed27bf2fe5a521.jpg"},{"name":"One Down","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2963890/e23f1bd9fa8e18e7462df73a28ed27bf2fe5a521.jpg"},{"name":"Two Down","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2963890/e23f1bd9fa8e18e7462df73a28ed27bf2fe5a521.jpg"},{"name":"Hat Trick","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2963890/e23f1bd9fa8e18e7462df73a28ed27bf2fe5a521.jpg"},{"name":"Four on the Floor","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2963890/e23f1bd9fa8e18e7462df73a28ed27bf2fe5a521.jpg"},{"name":"I've Got Five On It","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2963890/e23f1bd9fa8e18e7462df73a28ed27bf2fe5a521.jpg"},{"name":"Let's Talk About Six","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2963890/e23f1bd9fa8e18e7462df73a28ed27bf2fe5a521.jpg"},{"name":"Seventh Heaven","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2963890/e23f1bd9fa8e18e7462df73a28ed27bf2fe5a521.jpg"},{"name":"Theseus","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2963890/e23f1bd9fa8e18e7462df73a28ed27bf2fe5a521.jpg"}],"total":21},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2963890?t=1772555314","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2963890/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772555314","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2963890/7551f1defe53acf02ca3d75dabdea78d649accf5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772555314","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2963890/7551f1defe53acf02ca3d75dabdea78d649accf5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772555314","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This game contains mild references to suicide, abortion, evangelism, gym class, medicinal drugs, witchcraft, blood-drinking, live burial, devil-worship, fornication, blasphemy and secondary school education."},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1922. Miss Mulligatawney's School for Promising Girls is one of the best boarding schools in England. You are Verity Amersham, here on a scholarship - and today you're going to be expelled for attempted murder.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2963890/extras/cf93423e81f7adc21e105289e7de9031.poster.avif?t=1772555314\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2963890/extras/cf93423e81f7adc21e105289e7de9031.webm?t=1772555314\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2963890/extras/cf93423e81f7adc21e105289e7de9031.mp4?t=1772555314\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>From the creators of Overboard! and A Highland Song comes a highly replayable detective game with a wicked twist. Can you escape expulsion through fair means - or foul? Can you find the culprit - or someone else to take the blame?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Starring Amelia Tyler (Baldur's Gate 3) as Verity. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2963890/extras/cb675b0007905708fbf1bbb27442315c.poster.avif?t=1772555314\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2963890/extras/cb675b0007905708fbf1bbb27442315c.webm?t=1772555314\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2963890/extras/cb675b0007905708fbf1bbb27442315c.mp4?t=1772555314\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>GAMEPLAY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gossip, lie, steal, manipulate - but don't get caught! </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate the school day, talk to other characters, sneak around - and try not to get expelled! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your actions will affect other characters, who remember everything they see and hear.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everyone here has secrets - students and teachers alike. Remember, knowledge is power. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique morality system: the more EVIL you are, the more choices you'll have...  </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2963890/extras/909e733d35c4d7d82b88534c422f56cf.poster.avif?t=1772555314\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2963890/extras/909e733d35c4d7d82b88534c422f56cf.webm?t=1772555314\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2963890/extras/909e733d35c4d7d82b88534c422f56cf.mp4?t=1772555314\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DYNAMIC NARRATIVE CLOCKWORK</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Next-gen visual novel: go where you want, when you want, and say what you want. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simulated story-world: other characters move and act independently, remembering everything they see and hear - and everything you do. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every minute counts: you have one school day to escape punishment. The clock is always ticking! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Who can you trust? Some characters are friendly and some are out to get you. Who will you befriend? Who will you betray? </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2963890/extras/7faa3a1fc34af99dc8c0f6e659b13cd0.poster.avif?t=1772555314\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2963890/extras/7faa3a1fc34af99dc8c0f6e659b13cd0.webm?t=1772555314\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2963890/extras/7faa3a1fc34af99dc8c0f6e659b13cd0.mp4?t=1772555314\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >HIGHLY REPLAYABLE</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run is different, with new leads and new opportunities for mayhem.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Avoiding expulsion is just the start. Can you rise to the position of Head Girl?  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mysteries abound. Why is the cellar locked? What is your best friend's dark secret?  </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One play-through lasts about 30 - 45 minutes, but achieving that perfect run will take a lot longer... </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With music by jazz legends George Gershwin, Paul Whiteman, Louis Armstrong, Bessie Smith and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2963890/extras/485edd97842abae5123df84318e61d2a.poster.avif?t=1772555314\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2963890/extras/485edd97842abae5123df84318e61d2a.webm?t=1772555314\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2963890/extras/485edd97842abae5123df84318e61d2a.mp4?t=1772555314\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SOMEONE HAS TO TAKE THE FALL</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["inkle Ltd"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2963890/header.jpg?t=1772555314","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"(c) inkle Ltd","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 10.15 Catalina or higher<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 8th generation Intel Core processor<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> MacBook from 2018 or later<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 200 MB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 10.15 Catalina or higher<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple Silicon (M1 or later)<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 400 MB available space</li></ul>"},"metacritic":{"score":82,"url":"https://www.metacritic.com/game/pc/expelled!?ftag=MCD-06-10aaa1f"},"mov